#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:10
msgid "YouTube Content Tool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:12
msgid ""
"Extract transcripts from YouTube videos and convert them into useful "
"formats."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:14
msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:20
msgid "Helper Script"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:22
msgid ""
"`SKILL_DIR` is the directory containing this SKILL.md file. The script "
"accepts any standard YouTube URL format, short links (youtu.be), shorts, "
"embeds, live links, or a raw 11-character video ID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:38
msgid "Output Formats"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:40
msgid "After fetching the transcript, format it based on what the user asks for:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:42
msgid "**Chapters**: Group by topic shifts, output timestamped chapter list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:43
msgid "**Summary**: Concise 5-10 sentence overview of the entire video"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:44
msgid "**Chapter summaries**: Chapters with a short paragraph summary for each"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:45
msgid "**Thread**: Twitter/X thread format — numbered posts, each under 280 chars"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:46
msgid "**Blog post**: Full article with title, sections, and key takeaways"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:47
msgid "**Quotes**: Notable quotes with timestamps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:49
msgid "Example — Chapters Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:59
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:61
msgid ""
"**Fetch** the transcript using the helper script with `--text-only "
"--timestamps`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:62
msgid ""
"**Validate**: confirm the output is non-empty and in the expected "
"language. If empty, retry without `--language` to get any available "
"transcript. If still empty, tell the user the video likely has "
"transcripts disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:63
msgid ""
"**Chunk if needed**: if the transcript exceeds ~50K characters, split "
"into overlapping chunks (~40K with 2K overlap) and summarize each chunk "
"before merging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:64
msgid ""
"**Transform** into the requested output format. If the user did not "
"specify a format, default to a summary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:65
msgid ""
"**Verify**: re-read the transformed output to check for coherence, "
"correct timestamps, and completeness before presenting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:67
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:69
msgid ""
"**Transcript disabled**: tell the user; suggest they check if subtitles "
"are available on the video page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:70
msgid ""
"**Private/unavailable video**: relay the error and ask the user to verify"
" the URL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:71
msgid ""
"**No matching language**: retry without `--language` to fetch any "
"available transcript, then note the actual language to the user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/youtube-content_SKILL.md:72
msgid ""
"**Dependency missing**: run `pip install youtube-transcript-api` and "
"retry."
msgstr ""

